PART 8: useEffect EXECUTION FLOW
================================================================================

CONCEPTUAL EFFECT LIFECYCLE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Render
  ↓
React Commits Update
  ↓
Effect Setup Runs


If dependency changes:

Render
  ↓
Commit
  ↓
Previous Cleanup
  ↓
New Effect Setup


When component is removed:

Cleanup
  ↓
Component No Longer Present


================================================================================
MOUNT EXAMPLE
================================================================================

Component Appears
      ↓
Render
      ↓
Commit
      ↓
Effect Setup


================================================================================
DEPENDENCY CHANGE
================================================================================

userId:

10
 ↓
20


Component Renders with:

userId = 20


Then:

Previous Effect Cleanup
      ↓
Abort Request for User 10
      ↓
New Effect Setup
      ↓
Request User 20


================================================================================
UNMOUNT
================================================================================

Component Removed
      ↓
Effect Cleanup
      ↓
Cancel/Disconnect Resource


================================================================================
IMPORTANT STRICT MODE NOTE
================================================================================

During development with React Strict Mode, React may intentionally perform an
additional setup/cleanup cycle.


Conceptually you may observe:

Setup
 ↓
Cleanup
 ↓
Setup


This helps expose Effects whose setup and cleanup logic are not symmetrical.


Therefore:

DO NOT ASSUME DUPLICATE DEVELOPMENT LOGS
ALWAYS MEAN YOUR APPLICATION IS BROKEN.


Your Effect should be written so that:

SETUP
and
CLEANUP


can safely happen as needed.


================================================================================
EFFECT TIMELINE TABLE
================================================================================

+----------------------+-----------------------------------------------+
| SITUATION            | EFFECT BEHAVIOR                               |
+----------------------+-----------------------------------------------+
| Component mounts     | Setup after commit                            |
| Dependency changes   | Old cleanup, then new setup                   |
| Dependency unchanged | Effect does not rerun for that dependency     |
| Component unmounts   | Cleanup                                      |
| Strict Mode dev      | May perform extra setup/cleanup cycle         |
+----------------------+-----------------------------------------------+


